SparkyBin Browser is a fork of GNOME Web (Epiphany). The changes made relative to
upstream 51.1 are recorded in the NOTICE file.

0.1 - October 19, 2026
======================

First release of SparkyBin Browser, forked from GNOME Web 51.1.

* Changes relative to upstream 51.1:
  - Rebranded to SparkyBin Browser, with a new application ID, a new
    executable name and user data directories that no longer collide with a
    GNOME Web installation
  - WebExtensions are enabled by default
  - Fixed a number of crashes, use-after-frees and security issues in the
    WebExtension implementation, including a JavaScript injection in
    downloads.search(), a path traversal in downloads.download() and the
    extension API being handed to cross-origin frames
